@startuml
title Order Capture sequence based on the alternate Product model (Premium Fiber Internet, Quote based)

participant "Engagement layer" as EL
participant "Party Interaction Management\nTMFC023" as PIM
participant "Party Management\nTMFC028" as PM
participant "Product Order Capture & validation\nTMFC002" as POCV
participant "Product Configurator\nTMFC27" as PC
participant "Product catalog\nTMFC001" as PCAT
participant "Service Qualificaiton\nTMFC009" as SQ

activate EL
EL -> PIM : Select Product Offering = Premium\nInternet and stasrt Quote
activate PIM
PIM -> PM : Create new customer TMF: 632 - Party Management
activate PM
PM -> PM : New Customer\ncreated with ID
PM --> PIM : New Party - Individual -\nCustomer created
deactivate PM
PIM -> POCV : Create Quote for type = New Activation for PO =\nPremium Internet\nTMF648 Quote Management
deactivate PIM
activate POCV

EL -> PIM : User permission
activate PIM

POCV -> POCV : Create new Quote\nfor the customer

POCV -> PC : Configure PO = Premium Internet - TMF 760 -\nProduct Configuration management
activate PC
PC -> PCAT : Fetch PO = Premium Internet Offer:TMF 620 -\nProduct Catalog Management
activate PCAT
PCAT --> PC : Consume the PO with\nthe default configuration
PC -> PC : <color:red>Create Configuration\n<color:red>session</color>
deactivate PCAT
PC --> POCV : Consume the\nconfiguration for\nPremium Internet\nPO
deactivate PC

PIM --> EL : User protected\nresource
deactivate PIM

POCV -> POCV : <color:red>Map Configuration\n<color:red>session to the Quote</color>

POCV -> SQ : Conduct Service Feasibility for geographic site = service location: TMF 645 - Service Qualification
activate SQ
SQ --> POCV : Consume the service Qualification results for the service location
deactivate SQ

POCV -> POCV : Apply Service Qual results to the\ndefault configuration
deactivate EL

POCV -> PC : Reconfigure and Re price the configuration:\nTMF -679 Product Offering Qualification
activate PC
PC --> POCV : Consume the configuration for\nPremium Internet PO
deactivate PC
deactivate POCV

activate EL
activate POCV
POCV --> EL : View the Quote with the Configuration
EL -> POCV : Confirm Quote:
POCV -> POCV : Save and close Quote
deactivate POCV
deactivate EL

@enduml
